# macOS Windows 11 Theme

A Windows 11-inspired visual theme for macOS.

## What this repo is

This repo is a starter theme pack for people who want their Mac to feel and look more like Windows 11 while still running macOS.

It includes:

- wallpaper assets
- icon starter files
- installer and rollback scripts
- instructions for a simple desktop transformation

## Project goals

- make the desktop flatter and more minimal
- use Windows-inspired colors, contrast, and spacing
- apply a simple, lightweight theme without replacing the whole system

## Files

- `scripts/install-theme.sh` — apply theme settings
- `scripts/uninstall-theme.sh` — revert changes
- `assets/wallpapers/windows11-aurora.svg` — sample wallpaper
- `assets/icons/*.svg` — icon templates
- `docs/SETUP.md` — setup guide

## Notes

This is a cosmetic customization project. It is not a copy of Windows, and it does not replace the macOS system.
